    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"Minor\" is a bit vague for a Board briefing. If I'm being grilled on the risk profile, I need more than a qualitative assessment. Can you give me the actual confidence intervals or a variance percentage for these efficacy projections? I need to know exactly how much the data is swinging so I don't get blindsided if the Phase III numbers come back shaky.",
